# Spoken lines are CSV keys. Infantes hide; the Cid returns the lion.

~ start
=> joke

~ joke
Alvar: a3_leon.ring
Cid: a3_leon.wake
Alvar: a3_leon.joke
Pero: a3_leon.ferran_hide
Martin: a3_leon.diego_hide
=> END

~ mesura
Cid: a3_leon.mesura_done
Alvar: a3_leon.returned
=> END

~ rage
Cid: a3_leon.rage_done
Alvar: a3_leon.returned
=> END
